六連霸，六年來年年進榜前<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5</span>％；另有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">18</span>家為第六屆的新生力軍，其中，聚陽、永豐金、貿聯<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">-KY</span>、合庫金、醫揚及朋億等公司，為六屆來首度進榜前<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5</span>％。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">上市櫃公司治理評鑑已完成六屆<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">901</span>家上市公司及<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">699</span>家上櫃公司，共<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1,600</span>家列入評鑑。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">交易所統計，六屆年年蟬連前<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5</span>％的上市公司，計有統一、東元、裕隆、中華、聯電、台積電、玉山金、統一超、台灣大、創意、遠傳、信義等<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">12</span>家公司，成為公司治理評鑑的標竿。此外，聚陽、永豐金、貿聯<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">-KY</span>及合庫金<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4</span>家則為公司治理評鑑上路六屆以來，首度進榜前<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5</span>％，與中鋼、南亞科、中華電、彰銀、富邦金、開發金、兆豐金、致伸及台汽電等<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">13</span>家為第六屆（與第五屆比）新進榜，光是金融股就有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">6</span>家占了近半。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">櫃買市場方面，第六屆排名前<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5</span>％共有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">35</span>家上櫃公司，其中連續六屆都排名前<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5</span>％的有穩懋、太醫、台微體、新鼎、立凱<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">-KY</span>、世界、中光電、中美晶、龍巖、寶雅、元大期、頎邦、崑鼎投控等<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">13</span>家上櫃公司，而新進榜名單則有醫揚、朋億、千附、光隆、明安等<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5</span>家上櫃公司。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">另排名前<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5</span>％上櫃企業還有安心、聯亞、艾訊、璟德、欣銓、精材、崇越電、兆利、東洋、智擎、杏一、湯石照明、聖暉、萬潤、環球晶、朋程、大江等，公司治理能力亮眼。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">證交所副總羅贊興指出，第六屆公司治理評鑑依得分情形，區分為前<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5</span>％、<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">6</span>～<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">20</span>％、<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">21</span>～<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">35</span>％、<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">36</span>～<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">50</span>％、<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">51</span>～<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">65</span>％、<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">66</span>～<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">80</span>％，及<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">81</span>～<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">100</span>％等七個級距，分別依上市、上櫃受評公司公布評鑑結果。未來將持續強化公司治理評鑑效度，促進企業重視公司治理，落實企業社會責任，加速與國際接軌，增進資本市場發展。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">資料來源<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">: https://www.chinatimes.com/newspapers/20200501000200-260202?chdtv</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create